# This repo carries docs, specs and marketing source — NOT media binaries.
#
# Video masters and per-agency renders live in Cloudflare R2 and are referenced
# by URL at runtime (see voice-retell-elevenlabs/src/lib/marketing/catalogue.ts).
# They must never enter git history: a single `git add -A` in this directory
# would otherwise commit ~500MB of MP4s permanently, and git has no practical
# way to take that back.
#
# NOTE: this file only stops NEW files being added. Anything already tracked
# stays tracked until explicitly removed with `git rm --cached`.

# --- Video / audio masters and renders -------------------------------------
*.mp4
*.mov
*.webm
*.mkv
*.wav
*.mp3

# --- HyperFrames render projects and upload staging -------------------------
# Working directories: each holds a copy of a master plus rendered output.
marketing/promo/
marketing/promo-2/
marketing/promo-talkinghead/
marketing/video/
marketing/r2-upload/
# Per-agency render output (--out mode): videos AND their poster JPEGs. The
# *.mp4 rule alone would let the posters through.
marketing/agency-packs/
**/renders/

# --- Fonts ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Arial ships with the render projects for font-identical output. Proprietary,
# so it stays out of the repo and rides along in R2 instead.
*.ttf
*.otf

# --- Dependencies / build output --------------------------------------------
node_modules/
.next/
out/
build/
.vercel/
*.tsbuildinfo

# --- Secrets ----------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- Local tooling and OS junk ----------------------------------------------
.claude/
.agents/
skills-lock.json
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
